<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75421" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρυκ-τός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dug, formed by digging,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφρον ὑπερθορέονται ὀρυκτήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.179
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.7.14
			</span></i>; opp. a natural channel, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόματα,</span> opp.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰθαγενέα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.17
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίμνη</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				149
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1153
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴσοδοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.5.25
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποθῆκαι ὀ. ὑπόγειοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.770e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dug out, quarried,</i> of stone or metal, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὀ.,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μεταλλευτά,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				378a20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. χρυσός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					34.10.10
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.694
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.109
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθῦς ὀ.</span> fish <i>taken
				by digging</i> in sand, such as sand-eels, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				835b16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				171.7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.331c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archestr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				22
			</span></i>.</div>
